msgid "MCP Bundle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:5
#: 031ce6ae4c624a2da55bbe678d6729b8
msgid "What is MCPB?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:7
#: c3e8f386febc48d3a017e49b118242b1
msgid ""
"The **Model Context Protocol Bundle (MCPB)** is a standardized packaging "
"format designed to simplify the distribution and usage of Model Context "
"Protocol (MCP) servers. For **ToolUniverse**, the MCPB wraps the entire "
"ecosystem—including Python dependencies, the Node.js bridge, and the "
"server logic—into a single, standalone executable or bundle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:10
#: bcad95aa6b924abbb1e5c3b42cac8553
msgid "Why use MCPB with ToolUniverse?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:12
#: 3fac0b83ffd84ec691b33dfe26b9372b
msgid ""
"Traditionally, running an MCP server like ToolUniverse required setting "
"up a specific Python environment, installing dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:14
#: 7120678675694afb8c2eeb5d1ff3f964
msgid "**MCPB solves this by providing:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:16
#: e53a1a221a074ff1a528b6b6c52cd710
msgid ""
"**Zero Configuration**: No need to manage Python virtual environments or "
"install Node.js manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:17
#: ce31fca63f88457d954f7b99744f0289
msgid ""
"**One-Click Installation**: In supported clients like Claude Desktop, you"
" just drop the `.mcpb` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:18
#: ce46ef124f2e46179c9f53b0c8975bdc
msgid ""
"**Portability**: The bundle contains everything needed to run "
"ToolUniverse on your machine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:21
#: 648d50aa2deb452c941b9d80fb957fed
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:23
#: 240adb708c6d4b95a8501c38c3661a85
msgid "**Standalone Execution**: The bundle acts as a self-contained server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:24
#: 19d6219a1a8540a39beb0349bd03efb4
msgid ""
"**Seamless Integration**: Designed specifically for **Claude Desktop** "
"and other MCPB-aware clients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:25
#: bc0165c856354a6a8b9f8098d0f0df4e
msgid ""
"**Access to Scientific Tools**: Immediately unlocks 1000+ scientific "
"tools for your AI assistant without command-line setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:28
#: b50823e2c3d445678c8cbf6207077c38
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:30
#: dc04aaaf566747efa443b6331bd101ca
msgid "To use the ToolUniverse MCPB:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:32
#: 500f85deeac640e78db2ad2e404e8d26
msgid ""
"Download the latest release from our `GitHub Releases <https://github.com"
"/mims-harvard/ToolUniverse/releases/tag/mcpb>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:33
#: 719f431c272146699a476706adc8dc48
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in the `official Claude Desktop Guide "
"<https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/desktop-extensions>`_ to configure"
" it with your client."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/building_ai_scientists/mcpb_introduction.rst:35
#: 3d56f6e016db45c3b3cecea4966ef524
msgid ""
"For advanced users who wish to build the bundle from source or understand"
" the protocol details, please refer to the :doc:`MCP Support "
"<mcp_support>` documentation."
msgstr ""

